    {
      "id": "claim_1ef9964fa91d44ed8f5554dd50fa29d1",
      "statement": "block_inventory counts block kinds by substring match so differing parser vocabularies are handled safely — figure and picture both count as figures, and the image count accepts image, picture or figure — while links are counted from the markdown itself using a negative lookbehind so a markdown link is not also counted as a bare URL.",
