      "statement": "Four inventory conditions map to groups of readability criteria — absent images, tables, formulas or links — and the resulting proposal is intersected with the registry's na_possible whitelist, so the registry has the final say and the inventory cannot mark N/A a criterion the grid requires to be judged.",
