    {
      "id": "claim_a24cd7639c104d1aa925eb312cc2f10c",
      "statement": "Eight criteria are resolved by pattern matching over explicit textual evidence of document governance — authorship, version and date markers, update cadence, lifecycle status, change history, FAQ structure and content duplication — and are emitted directly as scored with the justification \"Signal deterministe.\"",
