    {
      "id": "claim_f20e4898277440599cdd8efda44954f8",
      "statement": "Most deterministic criteria grade binary 5-or-1 on presence of evidence, while the two versioning criteria are three-valued — 5 when both a version marker and a date are found, 3 when only one is, 1 when neither — and content duplication grades 5/3/1 against a measured duplicate fraction.",
